      "writtenOn": "2026-07-30T14:39:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The host can already DoS itself if it has that level of control. It doesn\u0027t even have to talk to hardware to do that, it just sends an invalid address in one of the hyp provided hvcs.\n\n`Could we refuse to process GITS_CWRITER while GITS_CTLR.Enabled is 0, and return -EBUSY` - I would like to avoid making another MMIO transaction on the back of the GITS_CWRITER to check the ITS enablement. We can probably check a shadow register but I don\u0027t believe it buys us too much TBH..",
